=\"message\">Ok.... Um...<br /> <br /> I'm new. Sorry.<br /> <br /> I've been thinking about entropy. Luck. Future sight.<br /> <br /> OK fine. You get a charm for good luck. You drink a drug that opens your mind and let's you see the last. Smoke and mirrors let's you have visions of the future. You get a voodoo doll, get a hair, and start stabbing with a needle. Look into your crystal ball.<br /> <br /> So things like luck manipulation, seeing into the future, and other things like that. How does the technocracy do it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Weird-ass space-time physics shit that my roommate somehow maths out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T14:39:43-07:00","id":1307306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1307281-technocracy-usage-of-entropy-and-time#post1307281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok.... Um...<br /> <br /> I'm new. Sorry.<br /> <br /> I've been thinking about entropy. Luck. Future sight.<br /> <br /> OK fine. You get a charm for good luck. You drink a drug that opens your mind and let's you see the last. Smoke and mirrors let's you have visions of the future. You get a voodoo doll, get a hair, and start stabbing with a needle. Look into your crystal ball.<br /> <br /> So things like luck manipulation, seeing into the future, and other things like that. How does the technocracy do it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Technocrats are likely to run simulations and models to predict future happenings or to investigate nodal points in an emergent system. Luck manipulation can be viewed as either influencing probability landscapes or waiting for critical junctures and acting. Again, simulations, math, and such as well as quite simply &quot;training&quot;. In the same way a hand-to-hand combatant can notice opportunities in a brawl, an entropy effect regarding luck can simply be a Procedure where a Technocrat with appropriate training will notice crowd movements and such.<br /> <br /> Much of Technocratic magic doesn't obviously look like magick but when the dice start rolling, they're much better equipped than most.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-23T15:02:56-07:00","id":1307310,"title":"","content":"One of my roommates favorite examples of Technocratic Entropy goes thusly:<br /> <br /> A witch casts a spell and curses an facility with all manner of foul luck and manner or rot.<br /> The technocrat institutes regular safety maintenance, seminars, and makes sure everyone signs waivers to counterspell it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}